OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening 
OL,6,Fwill be dry, perhaps the odd shower    
OL,7,Facross Shetland at first. Then the     
OL,8,Frest of the night will be largely dry, 
OL,9,Fa few showers possible across Shetland 
OL,10,Flater.                                 
OL,12,CSaturday:FA cloudy and increasingly    
OL,13,Fwindy day with a few showers across    
OL,14,FShetland, Orkney will be mostly dry    
OL,15,Funtil later when rain spreads north.   
OL,16,FStrong to gale southerly winds by      
OL,17,Fafternoon.                             
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
