OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny   
OL,6,Fintervals and a few passing showers on 
OL,7,FSunday and Tuesday. Windy with rain at 
OL,8,Ftimes on Monday, southwesterly gales.  
